%% Tenant-stamped asynchronous worker lifecycle
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Request as HTTP service
    participant TenantDB as Tenant PostgreSQL
    participant Queue as BullMQ queue
    participant Worker as Worker processor
    participant Control as Control-plane DB
    participant Context as Worker tenant context
    participant Manager as TenantDatabaseManager
    participant JobDB as Tenant PostgreSQL
    participant Ops as Metrics and audit

    Request->>TenantDB: Persist durable event or job intent in owning store
    Request->>Queue: Enqueue organizationId + entityId + idempotency key
    Queue-->>Worker: Deliver trusted job envelope
    Worker->>Worker: Validate required fields and lifecycle state
    Worker->>Control: Resolve organizationId to READY registry
    Control-->>Worker: Tenant database metadata
    Worker->>Context: Rebuild tenant context for job scope
    Worker->>Manager: Acquire bounded tenant Prisma client
    Manager->>JobDB: Run tenant-scoped idempotent operation

    alt Work succeeds
        JobDB-->>Worker: Durable result
        Worker->>Ops: Record success, latency, and tenant-safe metrics
        Worker-->>Queue: Complete job
    else Retryable dependency failure
        Worker->>Ops: Record attempt and sanitized failure
        Worker-->>Queue: Retry with bounded backoff
    else Permanent or malformed job
        Worker->>Ops: Record failure and dead-letter evidence
        Worker-->>Queue: Move to failed/dead-letter state
    end
